  "body": "PR #2274 (for P2 #2257) adds a progress overlay at the top centre of the viewport while an operation generates its toolpath. The user guide does not mention it yet.\n\nWait until #2274 is merged, then add one or two sentences to the guide section about generating a toolpath: what the overlay shows, that it goes away on success, refusal and cancel, and that the app stays usable meanwhile (whatever the merged PR does - check the code, do not guess).\n\nDone means: the guide's generate section describes the overlay as merged, with no screenshot committed (text only, or a picture rendered by the docs tooling).\n",
